committer Sean Khan <datapronix@protonmail.com> 1767397179 -0500

nss-firmware: use prepackaged tarball to avoid hash flakiness

Use the GitHub release tarball and pin PKG_HASH instead of building an
archive from the source tree. Different combinations of host tar and the
build's zstd produced inconsistent .tar.zst checksums (same reported
versions but different binaries), causing download/hash mismatches.

Signed-off-by: Sean Khan <datapronix@protonmail.com>
